&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All candidates must be legally authorized to work for any company in the country where this position is located without sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;OneStream Software is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race,&amp;nbsp;color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, sexual orientation, or gender identity), national origin, age, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable local laws, regulations, and ordinances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need&amp;nbsp;assistance&amp;nbsp;and/or a reasonable accommodation during the application process, reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OneStream may use the personal information you provide to process your application and contact you,&amp;nbsp;in accordance with&amp;nbsp;applicable privacy laws such as the CCPA and GDPR. For more information about how we handle your personal information, please review&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.onestream.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;OneStream&#39;s Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
